:BG49                      # default background (outside the picture)
  27 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 91 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 52 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 57 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 109 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 999 24131 T R
:DRAWROW                   # (screen row)  two screen pixel rows as half blocks
