  24180 F 24136 F M 65552 A 24182 T
  24179 F + 24157 F / DRB1OUT *
  24181 F 24137 F / DRB1OUT *
  24181 F 24136 F M 65552 A 24183 T DRB1D B
:DRB1OUT
  0 24183 T
:DRB1D
  24180 F 24169 F E 24179 F 24175 F E O 24184 T
  24181 F 24169 F E 24179 F + 24175 F E O 24183 F BOOL P 24185 T
  0 24186 T 0 24187 T
  24188 F DRNOAR J
  24180 F 24171 F E 24179 F 24177 F E O 24186 T
  24181 F 24171 F E 24179 F + 24177 F E O 24183 F BOOL P 24187 T
:DRNOAR
  0 24189 T 24161 F 24190 T 0 24191 T
:DRLP
  24189 F 24164 F / DREND *
  24190 F 24136 F / DRBLANK *
  24182 F 24190 F A F 24192 T
  24183 F DRBOUT J
  24183 F 24190 F A F 24193 T DRHAVE B
:DRBOUT
  999 24193 T
:DRHAVE
  24184 F 24185 F O DRNOC J
  24190 F 24168 F E 24189 F 24174 F E O DRNOC J
  24184 F DRC1 J
  24192 F CONTRAST C 24192 T
:DRC1
  24185 F DRNOC J
  24193 F CONTRAST C 24193 T
:DRNOC
  24186 F 24187 F O DRNOA J
  24190 F 24170 F E 24189 F 24176 F E O DRNOA J
  24186 F DRA1 J
  24192 F CONTRAST C 24192 T
:DRA1
  24187 F DRNOA J
  24193 F CONTRAST C 24193 T
:DRNOA
  24189 F 7 P DRROOM J
:DRCELL
  24193 F 999 E DRHALF *
  24192 F 24193 F E DRSAME *
  24192 F 24193 F COLORS C
  226 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 150 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 128 24128 F T 24128 PSTO DRNX B
:DRSAME
  24192 F SETBG C 32 24128 F T 24128 PSTO DRNX B
:DRHALF                    # the lower half is past the bottom of the picture
  24192 F SETFG C BG49 C 226 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 150 24128 F T 24128 PSTO 128 24128 F T 24128 PSTO DRNX B
:DRBLANK
