  D 1001 E VDU *
  D 1002 E VDD *
  D 1003 E VDR *
  D 1004 E VDL *
  D 1007 E VDPU *
  D 1008 E VDPD *
  D 2002 E VDWU *
  D 2003 E VDWD *
  D 60 E VDFL *
  D 44 E VDFL *
  D 62 E VDFR *
  D 46 E VDFR *
  ! 0 0 R
:VDU
  ! 0 24136 F 3 M S 1 R
:VDD
  ! 24136 F 3 M 1 R
:VDR
  ! 3 1 R
:VDL
  ! 0 3 S 1 R
:VDPU
  ! 0 24134 F 3 M S 1 R
:VDPD
  ! 24134 F 3 M 1 R
:VDWU
  ! 0 24136 F 9 M S 1 R
:VDWD
  ! 24136 F 9 M 1 R
:VDFL
  ! 0 1 S 1 R
:VDFR
  ! 1 1 R

:VKEYS
  24298 F VDELTA C VKMOVE *
  !
  24298 F 1005 E VHOME *
  24298 F 1006 E VEND *
  24298 F 2000 E VCLICK *
  24298 F 75 E VKEEP *
  24298 F 27 E VKEEP *
  24298 F 69 E KLOAD *
  24298 F 83 E KSAVE *
  24298 F 72 E KHELP *
  24298 F 63 E KHELP *
  24298 F 68 E KCARD *
  24298 F 81 E KQUIT *
  24298 F 87 E KPICSIZE *
  24298 F 35 E KSCREEN *
  24298 F 40 E KWDN *
  24298 F 41 E KWUP *
  24298 F 48 E KFIT *
  24298 F 85 E KUNDO *
  24298 F 89 E KREDO *
  24298 F 2001 E VKRET *
  MSG C OBFLUSH C "viewing a long file: K keeps this picture so you can draw on it" R
:VKRET
  R
:VKMOVE                    # (delta)  plus every scroll key already waiting
  24299 T
:VDRAIN
  1 4145 T 2 TSYS C VAPPLY J
  4149 F VDELTA C VDMORE *
  ! 1 24300 T 4149 F 24301 T 4150 F 24302 T 4151 F 24303 T 4152 F 24304 T VAPPLY B
:VDMORE
  24299 F A 24299 T VDRAIN B
:VAPPLY                    # clamp to the sequence, keeping the reading frame
  24260 F 3 M 24134 F 3 M S 0 MAX 24305 T
  24278 F 24299 F A 24306 T
:VCLAMP
  24306 F 0 L VCLO *
  24306 F 24305 F G VCHI *
  24306 F 24278 T VSHOW B
:VCLO
  24306 F 3 MOD 24278 T VSHOW B
:VCHI
  24305 F 24305 F 24306 F S 3 MOD S 24278 T
:VSHOW
  14 HOST C ! RELOAD C R
:VHOME
  24278 F 3 MOD 24278 T VSHOW B
:VEND                      # last screen, same reading frame
  24260 F 3 M 24134 F 3 M S 0 MAX 24305 T
  24305 F 24278 F S 3 V + 3 M 24278 F A 24306 T VCLAMP B
:VCLICK
  CLICKPX C VKRET J
  24307 F 24308 F MOVETO C
  24168 F 24169 F GETPX C 24195 T
  MSG C  25613  OBS C 24169 F 24136 F M 24168 F A 3 M 24278 F A + OBNC C
   25619  OBS C 24195 F AAINFO C R
:VKEEP
  VCLOSE C 0 24135 T 1 24142 T FULLDRAW C
  MSG C OBFLUSH C "this picture is yours now - draw away (E opens the file again)" R

:VPANEL                    # viewer info and a scrollbar on the screen's right edge
  16 PLINE C  25622  OBS C RESET C 23416 OBS C
  17 PLINE C  25630  OBS C
  18 PLINE C 2 OBSP C RESET C 24278 F + OBNC C
  19 PLINE C  25640  OBS C RESET C 24287 F OBNC C
  20 PLINE C  25644  OBS C RESET C 24278 F 3 MOD + OBN C 3 OBSP C
  24260 F 3 M 24134 F 3 M S 0 MAX 24305 T
  24278 F 100 M 24305 F 1 MAX V 100 MIN OBN C 37 OBC C
  21 PLINE C  25652  OBS C RESET C
  0 24132 T
:VSBLP
  24132 F 24149 F / VSBEND *
  24132 F 2 A 24164 F 2 A GOTO C
  24278 F 24149 F - M 24305 F 1 MAX V 24132 F E VSBTH *
  GREY C 24667 OBS C RESET C 24132 PSTO VSBLP B
:VSBTH
  56 SETFG C 24675 OBS C RESET C 24132 PSTO VSBLP B
:VSBEND
  R

:TBLINIT                   # codon -> its 3 letters (CB) and its BMP blue, green, red (BGRT)
  0 24132 T
:TBLP
  24132 F 64 / TBEND *
  24132 F 4 > 24611 A F 24132 F 3 M 23744 A T
  24132 F 2 > 3 P 24611 A F 24132 F 3 M 23744 A + T
  24132 F 3 P 24611 A F 24132 F 3 M 23744 A 2 A T
  24132 F 3 P 85 M 24132 F 3 M 23936 A T
  24132 F 2 > 3 P 85 M 24132 F 3 M 23936 A + T
  24132 F 4 > 85 M 24132 F 3 M 23936 A 2 A T
  24132 PSTO TBLP B
:TBEND
  R
:BTINIT                    # byte -> class: a/A 0  c/C 1  g/G 2  t/T u/U 3,
  0 24132 T                   # other letters (N ...) and - . count as 0, > is 5, the rest 9
:BTLP
  24132 F 128 / BTEND *
  9 24132 F 23464 A T
  24132 F 32 O 97 L BTN *
  24132 F 32 O 122 G BTN *
  0 24132 F 23464 A T
:BTN
  24132 PSTO BTLP B
:BTEND
  0 45 23464 A T 0 46 23464 A T 5 62 23464 A T 7 23464 T
  1 99 23464 A T 2 103 23464 A T 3 116 23464 A T 3 117 23464 A T
  1 67 23464 A T 2 71 23464 A T 3 84 23464 A T 3 85 23464 A T R

:OBNC                      # (n --)  decimal with thousands commas
  D 1000 L OBNCS *
  D 1000 V OBNC C
  44 OBC C 1000 MOD
  D 100 V 48 A OBC C D 10 V 10 MOD 48 A OBC C 10 MOD 48 A OBC C R
:OBNCS
  OBN B

