  "paint.aa needs GATCnux.py (version 4.4 or later) for keyboard and screen access." CR 1 Q
:TTYOFF
  "paint.aa needs the terminal bridge. Run it with --tty (and --fs to save):" CR
  "  python3 GATCnux.py run paint.aa --no-banner --tty --fs --max-steps 2000000000" CR 1 Q
:TTYOK
